WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.085 --> 00:00:05.800
The loud roar echoed through the woods.

2
00:00:05.801 --> 00:00:09.076
Father trembled with fear.

3
00:00:09.077 --> 00:00:12.540
"It's the monster!" he thought.

4
00:00:12.541 --> 00:00:15.926
He dropped the flower and started to run.

5
00:00:15.927 --> 00:00:18.053
But his leg was hurt.

6
00:00:18.054 --> 00:00:21.377
He couldn't run fast.

7
00:00:21.378 --> 00:00:27.362
A beast with sharp claws leaped at him.

8
00:00:27.363 --> 00:00:31.673
The monster pinned him to the ground.

9
00:00:31.674 --> 00:00:35.137
"How dare you take what is mine!"

10
00:00:35.138 --> 00:00:41.072
"Please . . . ," Father begged. "I meant no harm."

11
00:00:41.073 --> 00:00:46.725
"No harm?" The beast flashed his fangs.

12
00:00:46.726 --> 00:00:50.160
He let out a terrible growl.

13
00:00:50.161 --> 00:00:54.404
"You stole something from me!"

14
00:00:54.405 --> 00:00:59.721
"I'm sorry." Father's voice shook. "I . . .

15
00:00:59.722 --> 00:01:03.712
I only wanted to bring my daughter a present.

16
00:01:03.713 --> 00:01:08.508
She loves flowers, and I love her."

17
00:01:08.509 --> 00:01:13.372
"Love?" The beast stomped his foot.

18
00:01:13.373 --> 00:01:16.933
"Love never lasts."

19
00:01:16.934 --> 00:01:20.063
"Yes, it does," Father said.

20
00:01:20.064 --> 00:01:21.748
"Beauty and I—"

21
00:01:21.749 --> 00:01:25.719
"No more talk of love!" the beast snapped.

22
00:01:25.720 --> 00:01:28.917
"My flowers can only be given to someone.

23
00:01:28.918 --> 00:01:31.854
They can never be taken."

24
00:01:31.855 --> 00:01:34.523
Father tried to explain again.

25
00:01:34.524 --> 00:01:38.941
"You took without asking," Beast said.

26
00:01:38.942 --> 00:01:42.716
"Now you will be punished!"

27
00:01:42.717 --> 00:01:53.639
Beast dragged Father to a grand castle.

28
00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:57.622
He threw Father into a dark dungeon.

29
00:01:57.623 --> 00:02:05.053
The beast locked the cell and left.

30
00:02:05.054 --> 00:02:09.531
Father shivered.

31
00:02:09.532 --> 00:02:17.984
"I'll never see Beauty again," he thought.

32
00:02:17.985 --> 00:02:27.742
He cried himself to sleep.

33
00:02:27.743 --> 00:02:32.201
When Father awoke, he was cold and hungry.

34
00:02:32.202 --> 00:02:35.939
Several birds flew into his cell.

35
00:02:35.940 --> 00:02:43.441
They brought soup and a blanket.

36
00:02:43.442 --> 00:02:48.773
"Thank you," Father said in surprise.

37
00:02:48.774 --> 00:02:51.453
He drank the soup.

38
00:02:51.454 --> 00:02:54.505
He warmed himself with the blanket.

39
00:02:54.506 --> 00:02:58.544
Soon Father felt a bit better.

40
00:02:58.545 --> 00:03:02.312
He told the birds about Beauty.

41
00:03:02.313 --> 00:03:06.966
"She's kind and gentle like you."

42
00:03:06.967 --> 00:03:12.347
They chirped and flew out of the dungeon.

43
00:03:12.348 --> 00:03:14.772
Father shook his head.

44
00:03:14.773 --> 00:03:20.677
"This must be a dream," he thought.

45
00:03:20.678 --> 00:03:30.864
Then he fell back asleep.

